<title>USA: Gateway 2000 expands manufacturing plant.</title>
<headline>Gateway 2000 expands manufacturing plant.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH SIOUX CITY, S.D. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gateway 2000 Inc said Tuesday it will expand its manufacturing plant in Hampton, Virginia, adding 300 jobs at the facility.</p>
<p>The Hampton plant, which currently has more than 650 employees, began production of desktop computers in July of 1996. The expansion project will increase production capacity by 50 percent, the company said.</p>
<p>Gateway said it is also adding a technical support call center at the facility that will be operational in the second quarter.</p>
<p>Gateway is a direct marketer of personal computers.</p>
<p>Its shares were off 7/8 Tuesday at 56-3/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
